scenario: known_source_scope
A known country, ASN or client silences only a new place of its own kind, so one false positive cannot blind a key to a thief from the same country or using the same SDK; a known CIDR silences the whole request. The key's known sources are country DE, ASN 3320, client health/1 and CIDR 192.0.2.0/24.

